ries in one episode we  might find Swamp fire telepathically  communicating with plants using his mind  to make them grow and creating organic  matter seemingly out of nowhere in  another episode you might find him  projecting seeds and gases at any one of  his opponents if we had these incredible  skills we definitely take up gardening  just think of all the rich meaty  Tomatoes he could grow beyond chloro  Kinesis swamp fire has the power to  ignite methane in his palms which  creates his very own flamethrower he's  also able to use this methane as a form  of propulsion taking temporary flight at  a moment's notice with all these amazing  abilities you might be wondering what  swamp fires weaknesses  well like almost all plant matter this  alien is susceptible to being frozen an  alien this awesome definitely needs a  totally rockin doppelganger and we found  just the match check out this real-life  version of swamp fire pictured here with  forearms this costume work might be the  most in-depth of them all don't you  think  from head to toe whoever put this outfit  together did not miss a single detail  SpiderMonkey if you were going to think  of the scariest animal combinations  what's the first thing that comes to  mind perhaps you think of a lion shark  or maybe even a donkey cat well don't  waste one more brain cell thinking about  it because we've got the ultimate combo  the spider monkey believe it or not  spider monkeys do exist in the wild but  the version featured in Ben 10 is even  more unbelievable even from first glance  you can tell that this four-armed alien  has a lot going on besides his bright  blue color the next thing you might  notice about spider monkey is that he  has four green eyes this attribute  combined with his extremely versatile  tail makes this furry alien extremely  agile in fact did you know that spider  monkey can actually create webs using  his tail as if that wasn't cool enough  he can also stick to and scale vertical  surfaces 